  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e1563fb8-5518-4034-b33a-c72ba190f6e8",
    "name": "Checkmate Test Management Projects API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Comprehensive API documentation for Checkmate - a modern test case management system built with Remix, MySQL, and Drizzle ORM.\n\n## Features\n- Project and Test Management\n- Test Run Execution\n- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n- Google OAuth Authentication\n- Test Status Tracking and History\n\n## Authentication\nAll endpoints require authentication via session cookies. Users must be logged in through Google OAuth.\n\n## Authorization\nAccess to resources is controlled via Casbin RBAC with three role levels:\n- **Admin**: Full access to all resources\n- **User**: Can create, read, update resources\n- **Reader**: Read-only access\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Checkmate API Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
}